{"3082510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starbox", "steam_appid": 3082510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starbox is a game about transgalactic exploration, discovery, battle, and conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently only features the single player and multiplayer battle modes, where you find yourself in a three-dimensionally looped &quot;Starbox&quot; in outer space to fight it out for your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons include lasers, dumbfire and homing missiles, some of which have huge detonations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A future release will include a campaign mode where you explore, discover and take over nearby inhabitable planets. The random planet generator that will be used in campaign mode is currently available to create your own planets in the Planet Generator screen.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starbox is a game about transgalactic exploration, discovery, battle, and conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently only features the single player and multiplayer battle modes, where you find yourself in a three-dimensionally looped &quot;Starbox&quot; in outer space to fight it out for your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons include lasers, dumbfire and homing missiles, some of which have huge detonations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A future release will include a campaign mode where you explore, discover and take over nearby inhabitable planets. The random planet generator that will be used in campaign mode is currently available to create your own planets in the Planet Generator screen.</p>", "short_description": "Starbox is a 3D &quot;looped&quot; space-shooter where you get use of many different weapons, including lasers, dumbfire and homing missiles. When you go out one side of the looped 3D space, you come into the other!", "supported_languages